==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|fjall}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/fjatl/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|atl|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|n|fjalls|fjöll}}

# [[mountain]]
#* [[w:en:Hávamál|Hávamál]] ([[s:en:Poetic Edda/Hávamál|English source]], [[s:is:Hávamál|Icelandic sourve]])
#*: ''Elds er þörf''
#*: ''þeim er inn er kominn''
#*: ''og á kné kalinn.''
#*: ''Matar og voða''
#*: ''er manni þörf,''
#*: ''þeim er hefir um '''fjall''' farið.''
#*:: Fire he needs
#*:: who with frozen knees
#*:: Has come from the cold without;
#*:: Food and clothes
#*:: must the farer have,
#*:: The man from the '''mountains''' come.

